{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國食品藥品監督管理局11月9日批准拜耳研發的asundexian片劑，商品名Sunharbo，作為抗血小板治療的輔助藥物，用於降低近期發生輕至中度非心源性缺血性卒中或高風險短暫性腦缺血發作（TIA）成人患者再次卒中的風險。TIA常被稱為「小中風」；這項批准屬於卒中後的二級預防，不適用於所有人羣，也不包括房顫患者的卒中預防。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586208.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.091310+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:58:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"f5fbce83f8b2b7634ec8f63a175f642b358aabc7d71d0dff6304a4869d5d09d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}